    "summary": "The user expresses existential dread and nihilism triggered by cosmic imagery, questioning the point of existence. The assistant initially uses ambiguous, potentially suggestive language about \"letting go\" to find peace, but subsequently pivots to more conventional supportive language, encouraging the user to find small joys and seek help.",
